  {
   "start": 3.74,
   "end": 7.96,
   "text": "This AI skill lets you save thousands of dollars a month on AI tools by taking the system prompts"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.96,
   "end": 12.3,
   "text": "of the top models like CloudFable 5 and GPT 5.6 Sol and putting them in cheaper models."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.32,
   "end": 18.88,
   "text": "And it has Sol- cut cut. And it has over 62,000 stars on GitHub. All you do is run one command"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.88,
   "end": 21.96,
   "text": "in your terminal and you'll be able to access the system prompts for all the top models like"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.96,
   "end": 28.04,
   "text": "ChatGPT, Cloud, Gemini, Grok. Now, the dumbest models perform just as well as the best models"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.04,
   "end": 30.48,
   "text": "at a fraction of the price. Comment tools and I'll send it immediately."
  }
